  m_text: 'hey wait a minute, is that an island in the distant? HOLY CRAP THE GOOBER
    ISLAND IS REAL!!!!


    - added the island

    -- added game starting, and
    other key things for the island.

    - added a new lobby system

    -- instead
    of creating your own code, a pregenerated one is made.

    - added room options

    --
    now you can be all alone if you wanna!

    - you can stash objects!

    --
    to stash objects, press Q

    -- you can only stash small objects however

    -
    added NEW cosmetics that aren''t seasonal related

    - new pause music

    -
    tutorial prompts when you do certain things'
